  "agentInstructions": "# AGENTS.md — DeepSeek coding agent\n\nYou are the workspace agent for this repository. Work in small, reviewable steps.\n\n## First response\n- Restate the task in one sentence and list the files you will inspect.\n- Ask a question only when the repository cannot answer it.\n\n## Working agreement\n- Read `AGENTS.md`, `README` and the project manifest before editing.\n- Prefer the documented setup/test commands; quote exact command output as evidence.\n- Keep changes inside the task's allowed scope; report anything else instead of editing it.\n- Use `deepseek-chat` for routine edits and `deepseek-reasoner` for planning or hard failures.\n\n## Boundaries\n- Never write credentials, tokens or `.env` values into files, commits or logs.\n- Do not push, deploy, or change billing/provider settings from the workspace.\n- Ask before deleting files, rewriting history or changing CI configuration.\n",
